Just Built: HavenReal — A Full-Stack Luxury Real Estate Portal & CRM! 🏡

This the final project of my 3skill internship

I’m excited to share my latest full-stack web application: HavenReal — a complete, turnkey Real Estate Portal & Management System designed to bridge the gap between luxury property sellers, buyers, renters, and real estate agents! 🌇

Built with a dual-mode architecture, HavenReal operates seamlessly as a lightning-fast Single-Page Application (SPA) or as a full-stack Node.js + Express + SQLite REST API application.

🌟 Key Features & Architectural Highlights:
🏡 1. Curated Property Listings & Interactive Galleries
• Mobile-first responsive grid displaying high-res photography, purpose tags (FOR SALE / FOR RENT), and ★ FEATURED badges.
• Interactive Property Details Modal with a multi-image carousel, architectural descriptions, amenity tags, and listing agent contact cards.

🔍 2. Real-Time 6-Parameter Search & Filter Engine
• Instant multi-criteria filtering across keyword search, metropolitan cities, purpose, property type, and bedroom thresholds—with zero page reloads!
• Live sorting (Price: Low to High, Newest First, Featured First) with a real-time results counter and empty-state recovery.

🔐 3. Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) & Separate Login Gateways
• User Login Gateway: Allows buyers/renters to sign in and automatically pre-fills their contact details when inquiring about properties.
• Secure Admin Gateway: Protected administrative login portal (#view-admin-login) with route guarding and authenticated session controls.

❤️ 4. One-Click Favourites & Bookmarking System
• Interactive heart toggles with a live counter badge in the navigation bar and a dedicated Favourites Drawer that persists across sessions.

🛡️ 5. Executive Admin CRUD Dashboard & Lead CRM
• Inventory Management: Add new listings (with auto-generated slugs and price labels), Edit attributes, Delete properties, and toggle Featured badges.
• Lead Inquiry CRM: Review incoming customer messages and manage sales lifecycle stages (New Lead ➔ Contacted ➔ Closed).

🛠️ Technology Stack:
💻 Frontend: Semantic HTML5, Utility-first Tailwind CSS, Custom Glassmorphism UI (backdrop-filter), Plus Jakarta Sans typography, & modular Vanilla ES6+ JavaScript.
⚙️ Backend: Node.js (v18+), Express.js (v4), & SQLite3 relational SQL database.
🔒 Security & Storage: Prepared parameterized SQL statements (zero SQLi), client-side input sanitization, and dual-layer state persistence (localStorage + SQLite).

💡 Why This Project Stands Out:
HavenReal demonstrates clean MVC architecture, RESTful API design, state synchronization, and seamless UX micro-interactions without relying on heavy frontend frameworks. Whether running standalone in the browser or deployed as a Node server, it delivers an enterprise-ready real estate marketplace!

Thank you 3skill for giving me this great opportunity 

